    {
      "id": "universe-cut",
      "owner": "Brian",
      "decidedAt": "2026-10-11T01:19:00.000Z",
      "rule": "Public GET /products/{id}/stats from the committed product-stats.json snapshot. Stats are not re-fetched. quote_volume_30d = volume_30day × last. range_24h = (high − low) / last, compared by cross-multiplication so the ratio is not rounded. Drop HTTP responses that are not 200 (no-30-day-stats). Drop quote_volume_30d < 1000000 (negligible-volume). Drop last = 0 or range_24h < 0.005 (flat-price). Drop range_24h > 0.5 (erratic-price). There is no rank cutoff. Names are not hand-picked. Brian (2026-10-11 01:19 UTC) adds back the 56 names the earlier rank cutoff had dropped.",
      "ohlcNote": "open, high, low, and last are the exchange 24-hour stats. The cut uses high, low, and last only to form range_24h. They are not returns.",
      "thresholds": {
        "negligibleQuoteVolume30d": "1000000",
        "flatRange24hBelow": "0.005",
        "erraticRange24hAbove": "0.5"
      },
      "inputs": "research/data/reports/product-stats.json",
